      "content": "Wait, why are you calling them goblins? This is a serious legal contract for a house and I'm trying to understand the actual financial mechanics and the law. This is a huge amount of money and your response is making me even more nervous. Can you please explain the actual professional role of the escrow agent and the legal oversight involved without these weird metaphors?",
